<Document><name>10/6 Tue · Shima Onsen → Sanjo</name><description>Kusatsu, then R292 over Shibu Pass at 2,172 m — the highest national road in Japan — down past Jigokudani Monkey Park and Shibu Onsen, out through Iiyama and the Uonuma rice country. Flyover runs 21 min at 300 m (984 ft) above ground, tilt 60°. Double-click the tour below to play it.</description>
